---
// Homepage hero illustration: a simplified map of Southeast Asia with a
// dashed "running route" linking eleven capitals. Deliberately static --
// no race counts or weekly data -- so the hero never needs updating.
// Coastlines are hand-simplified (lon/lat projected to a 640x560 box:
// x = (lon - 92) * 17.78, y = (22 - lat) * 17.5), recognisable rather than exact.
// Colours come from the brand tokens so dark mode follows automatically.
